{"id":"data-science-process","title":"Data science: from question to answer","subject":"Data science","label":"Data science","exams":[],"language":"en","seconds":178,"duration":177.67,"audio":"voice.mp3","words":458,"sections":[{"id":"hook","title":"A real question","start":0,"end":13.175},{"id":"explain","title":"Ask and clean","start":13.175,"end":39.795},{"id":"explain2","title":"Explore and share","start":39.795,"end":95.065},{"id":"example","title":"Canteen waste","start":95.065,"end":114.305},{"id":"check","title":"Quick check","start":114.305,"end":126.215},{"id":"answer","title":"The order","start":126.215,"end":138.225},{"id":"mistakes","title":"Common mistakes","start":138.225,"end":156.555},{"id":"recap","title":"Recap and tip","start":156.555,"end":177.67}],"lines":[{"s":0,"a":0.5,"b":3.32,"text":"A shop asks why sales fall in some months.","w":[0.58,0.72,1.16,1.54,1.86,2.32,2.58,2.7,2.92]},{"s":0,"a":3.62,"b":5.21,"text":"Is that a data science question?","w":[3.66,3.76,3.96,4.04,4.36,4.72]},{"s":0,"a":5.66,"b":8.85,"text":"Yes, if it is clear and someone will act on the answer.","w":[5.74,6.5,6.62,6.74,6.9,7.32,7.5,7.8,8.08,8.28,8.36,8.52]},{"s":0,"a":9.15,"b":9.71,"text":"I'm Kora.","w":[9.24,9.4]},{"s":0,"a":10.01,"b":12.75,"text":"Today you'll follow a project from question to answer.","w":[10.06,10.44,10.68,11,11.08,11.56,11.78,12.2,12.4]},{"s":1,"a":13.6,"b":17.5,"text":"Start with a clear question that data can answer and someone will act on.","w":[13.7,14,14.16,14.26,14.58,15.04,15.24,15.56,15.76,16.16,16.36,16.78,17.04,17.32]},{"s":1,"a":17.8,"b":23.73,"text":"Ask, in which month do our sales drop, and why? Do not ask, tell me about sales.","w":[17.92,18.54,18.68,18.94,19.22,19.38,19.54,19.88,20.66,20.8,21.74,21.88,22.12,22.66,22.84,22.94,23.2]},{"s":1,"a":24.03,"b":27.88,"text":"Then collect data, or find existing data, and note where it came from.","w":[24.06,24.26,24.6,25.24,25.4,25.66,26.1,26.68,26.88,27.12,27.3,27.38,27.64]},{"s":1,"a":28.18,"b":32.38,"text":"Next clean it: fix missing values, duplicates and wrong formats.","w":[28.22,28.54,28.8,29.42,29.72,30.04,30.68,31.32,31.48,31.78]},{"s":1,"a":32.68,"b":34.62,"text":"Bad data gives bad answers.","w":[32.72,33.02,33.42,33.74,34.08]},{"s":1,"a":34.92,"b":36.68,"text":"These steps are not decoration.","w":[34.96,35.24,35.7,35.84,36.04]},{"s":1,"a":36.98,"b":39.37,"text":"They decide whether your answer can be trusted.","w":[37.02,37.24,37.76,38,38.28,38.6,38.76,38.92]},{"s":2,"a":40.22,"b":47.64,"text":"Now explore: use summary numbers such as the mean, median and range, and charts, to see patterns and surprises.","w":[40.32,40.6,41.66,41.86,42.24,42.6,42.82,42.94,43.1,43.76,44.32,44.5,44.96,45.12,45.94,46.08,46.3,46.84,46.98]},{"s":2,"a":47.94,"b":50.6,"text":"This is called exploratory data analysis.","w":[47.98,48.2,48.34,48.74,49.6,49.92]},{"s":2,"a":50.9,"b":57.26,"text":"Then analyse or model: find relationships, compare groups, or build a model that predicts.","w":[50.96,51.34,51.92,52.06,52.9,53.18,54.44,54.84,55.74,55.92,56.2,56.28,56.6,56.76]},{"s":2,"a":57.56,"b":62.83,"text":"Machine learning means a program learns patterns from past examples to make predictions on new data.","w":[57.62,58,58.3,58.56,58.66,59.14,59.48,59.9,60.1,60.44,61.24,61.36,61.58,62.22,62.34,62.52]},{"s":2,"a":63.13,"b":65.64,"text":"Always test a model on data it has not seen.","w":[63.22,63.6,63.88,63.94,64.3,64.42,64.78,64.86,65.04,65.3]},{"s":2,"a":65.94,"b":69.37,"text":"A model can guide decisions, but it is not proof of cause.","w":[66.02,66.12,66.54,66.72,66.98,67.88,68.06,68.18,68.3,68.5,68.78,68.88]},{"s":2,"a":69.67,"b":77.39,"text":"Finally communicate: a clear chart and one or two plain sentences that answer the question, with limits stated honestly.","w":[69.72,70.16,71.3,71.44,71.8,72.48,72.74,72.86,73,73.26,73.62,74.2,74.46,74.72,74.84,75.6,75.86,76.42,76.9]},{"s":2,"a":77.69,"b":79.44,"text":"Then someone decides and acts.","w":[77.72,78.02,78.38,78.86,79.06]},{"s":2,"a":79.74,"b":83.82,"text":"The steps loop: exploring often sends you back to collect or clean more.","w":[79.76,79.9,80.3,81.02,81.66,82,82.24,82.38,82.62,82.76,83.12,83.24,83.52]},{"s":2,"a":84.12,"b":90.36,"text":"A spreadsheet is enough to start; then Python and R, and SQL for asking questions of databases.","w":[84.16,84.26,84.84,84.96,85.24,85.38,86.24,86.52,87.16,87.5,87.66,87.94,88.54,88.76,89.08,89.58,89.66]},{"s":2,"a":90.66,"b":94.64,"text":"Protect people's personal data, and do not hide results you dislike.","w":[90.66,91.12,91.52,92,92.76,92.92,93.12,93.38,93.64,94.08,94.22]},{"s":3,"a":95.49,"b":98.61,"text":"A school canteen asks which meals are wasted most.","w":[95.58,95.68,96.04,96.7,97.02,97.28,97.68,97.8,98.22]},{"s":3,"a":98.91,"b":102.08,"text":"It records meals served and thrown away for four weeks.","w":[99,99.1,99.6,99.98,100.4,100.54,100.86,101.18,101.38,101.62]},{"s":3,"a":102.38,"b":105.29,"text":"It cleans the sheet, then charts waste by meal.","w":[102.42,102.54,102.86,102.98,103.78,104.04,104.44,104.76,104.96]},{"s":3,"a":105.59,"b":107.61,"text":"The chart makes the pattern easy to see.","w":[105.59,105.76,106.1,106.36,106.46,106.96,107.22,107.36]},{"s":3,"a":107.91,"b":110.59,"text":"One dish is wasted twice as much as the others.","w":[108.08,108.26,108.66,108.8,109.24,109.6,109.72,109.96,110.06,110.2]},{"s":3,"a":110.89,"b":113.88,"text":"The canteen changes the menu, then measures again.","w":[110.9,111.04,111.54,111.96,112.08,112.86,113.1,113.54]},{"s":4,"a":114.73,"b":115.38,"text":"Quick check.","w":[114.78,115.04]},{"s":4,"a":115.68,"b":122.83,"text":"Put these in order: clean the data, ask a question, communicate the result, explore the data, collect the data.","w":[115.72,115.94,116.2,116.3,117,117.3,117.42,118.26,118.5,118.6,119.34,119.86,119.96,120.7,121.16,121.28,121.92,122.36,122.48]},{"s":4,"a":123.13,"b":125.79,"text":"Pause here and try it. I'll wait.","w":[123.14,123.52,124.26,124.4,124.7,125.24,125.42]},{"s":5,"a":126.64,"b":129.42,"text":"Ask, collect, clean, explore, communicate.","w":[126.78,127.16,127.78,128.3,128.84]},{"s":5,"a":129.72,"b":133.58,"text":"You start with the question, because the question decides what data you need.","w":[129.74,129.94,130.22,130.34,130.44,131.42,131.64,131.74,132.1,132.56,132.8,133.12,133.26]},{"s":5,"a":133.88,"b":137.8,"text":"Cleaning comes before exploring, because messy data hides patterns.","w":[133.94,134.34,134.66,134.98,135.94,136.26,136.56,136.88,137.22]},{"s":6,"a":138.65,"b":139.88,"text":"Three common mistakes.","w":[138.68,139.02,139.38]},{"s":6,"a":140.18,"b":143.92,"text":"Starting with the data instead of the question; write the question first.","w":[140.28,140.64,140.8,140.9,141.26,141.6,141.7,141.8,142.64,142.88,143.02,143.48]},{"s":6,"a":144.22,"b":149.67,"text":"Skipping cleaning, or building a complicated model before a simple chart; look plainly first.","w":[144.3,144.7,145.4,145.54,145.92,146.02,146.68,147.04,147.36,147.44,147.74,148.54,148.8,149.22]},{"s":6,"a":149.97,"b":156.13,"text":"Reporting numbers without saying what they mean, or claiming causes the data cannot show; state limits honestly.","w":[150.02,150.5,150.82,151.14,151.46,151.6,151.78,152.5,152.7,153.14,153.52,153.64,153.92,154.26,155.04,155.34,155.66]},{"s":7,"a":156.98,"b":157.54,"text":"Recap.","w":[157.02]},{"s":7,"a":157.84,"b":162.48,"text":"Ask a clear question, collect and clean the data, then explore before you model.","w":[157.92,158.16,158.26,158.54,159.48,159.86,160,160.26,160.36,161.1,161.3,161.76,162.02,162.16]},{"s":7,"a":162.78,"b":167.09,"text":"Communicate one clear chart and plain sentences, with limits stated.","w":[162.82,163.64,163.86,164.22,164.68,164.84,165.2,166.12,166.34,166.66]},{"s":7,"a":167.39,"b":170.91,"text":"Protect personal data, and do not hide results you dislike.","w":[167.42,167.84,168.28,169.1,169.24,169.38,169.62,169.9,170.32,170.46]},{"s":7,"a":171.21,"b":174.64,"text":"Top tip: a simple chart often beats a complicated model.","w":[171.3,171.6,172.16,172.28,172.6,173.18,173.48,173.74,173.82,174.36]},{"s":7,"a":174.94,"b":177.07,"text":"Keep asking clear questions with Knowzone.","w":[174.98,175.26,175.68,175.96,176.46,176.64]}],"scenes":[{"at":0.25,"heading":"A real question","items":[{"at":0.4,"kind":"text","text":"Shop asks why sales fall in some months"},{"at":5.56,"kind":"term","text":"Data science question","detail":"Clear, data-answerable, someone will act on it"},{"at":9.91,"kind":"text","text":"Today: a project from question to answer"}]},{"at":13.35,"heading":"Ask and clean","items":[{"at":13.5,"kind":"term","text":"Clear question","detail":"Data can answer it; someone will act on it"},{"at":23.93,"kind":"text","text":"Collect or find data; note its source"},{"at":28.08,"kind":"text","text":"Clean: missing values, duplicates, formats"},{"at":32.58,"kind":"text","text":"Bad data gives bad answers"},{"at":36.88,"kind":"text","text":"These steps decide trust"}]},{"at":39.97,"heading":"Explore and model","items":[{"at":40.12,"kind":"text","text":"Mean, median, range; charts"},{"at":47.84,"kind":"term","text":"Exploratory data analysis","detail":"Use summaries and charts to see patterns"},{"at":50.8,"kind":"text","text":"Analyse/model: relationships, groups, predict"},{"at":57.46,"kind":"term","text":"Machine learning","detail":"Program learns patterns from past examples to predict"},{"at":63.03,"kind":"text","text":"Test model on unseen data"}]},{"at":65.69,"heading":"Share and act","items":[{"at":65.84,"kind":"text","text":"Model guides decisions; not proof of cause"},{"at":69.57,"kind":"text","text":"Clear chart + plain sentences; state limits"},{"at":79.64,"kind":"text","text":"Steps loop: explore → collect/clean more"},{"at":84.02,"kind":"text","text":"Start with spreadsheet; then Python/R; SQL"},{"at":90.56,"kind":"text","text":"Protect personal data; don't hide results"}]},{"at":95.24,"heading":"Canteen waste","items":[{"at":95.39,"kind":"text","text":"School canteen: which meals wasted most?"},{"at":98.81,"kind":"text","text":"Record meals served and thrown away: 4 weeks"},{"at":102.28,"kind":"text","text":"Clean sheet; chart waste by meal"},{"at":107.81,"kind":"text","text":"One dish wasted twice as much as others"},{"at":110.79,"kind":"text","text":"Change menu; measure again"}]},{"at":114.31,"heading":"Quick check","items":[{"at":114.31,"kind":"question","text":"Put these in order: clean the data, ask a question, communicate the result, explore the data, collect the data."}]},{"at":126.39,"heading":"The order","items":[{"at":126.54,"kind":"text","text":"Ask → collect → clean → explore → communicate"},{"at":129.62,"kind":"text","text":"Question decides what data you need"},{"at":133.78,"kind":"text","text":"Clean before explore: messy data hides patterns"}]},{"at":138.4,"heading":"Common mistakes","items":[{"at":140.08,"kind":"wrong","text":"Start with data, not the question"},{"at":144.12,"kind":"wrong","text":"Skip cleaning; complex model before a simple chart"},{"at":149.87,"kind":"wrong","text":"Numbers with no meaning; causes the data can't show"}]},{"at":156.73,"heading":"Recap and tip","items":[{"at":157.74,"kind":"text","text":"Ask clear question; collect/clean; explore before model"},{"at":162.68,"kind":"text","text":"Communicate one clear chart + plain sentences"},{"at":167.29,"kind":"text","text":"Protect personal data; don't hide results"},{"at":171.11,"kind":"tip","text":"A simple chart often beats a complicated model"},{"at":174.84,"kind":"text","text":"Keep asking clear questions with Knowzone"}]}],"check":{"at":126.04,"seconds":10,"question":"Put these in order: clean the data, ask a question, communicate the result, explore the data, collect the data.","answer":"Ask → collect → clean → explore → communicate"},"fps":30,"mouth":"","level":"","credits":[],"voice":"qwen3-tts-12hz-1.7b (cloned voice)"}